1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
In the meantime though I finally found out what brand these boots are they're charlotte russe.
与此同时，我终于查到了这双靴子的牌子，是 Charlotte Russe。

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,760
What a millennial throwback so crazy.
真是千禧一代的回忆，太有年代感了。

3
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:10,720
They actually were not too bad considering that they're not from a very great brand.
考虑到它并不是什么很出色的牌子，其实还不算差。

4
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:14,520
They didn't look super cheap in my opinion the toes were super pointy.
在我看来，它们不显得特别廉价，鞋头非常尖。

5
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:18,800
They definitely were a little bit big for me as you can see but honestly not too bad.
如你们所见，它们对我确实有点大，但说真的，不算太差。

6
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:25,080
And honestly some of the other cheaper alternatives that people get on amazon and shein for bachelorette parties they look way worse than these do.
而且有些人为了单身派对从亚马逊或 Shein 买的便宜替代款，我觉得看着比这双差多了。

7
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:29,280
Like these honestly look pretty dang good and I'd believe you if you said they were from free people.
这双真的挺好看，如果你说是 Free People，我会信。

8
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:34,360
And honestly I was kind of considering these the only thing is goodwill marked these for 13 I don't know why.
我其实有考虑买，唯一问题是 Goodwill 标十三，我不懂为什么。

9
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:37,640
I do think that these being marked for 15 definitely makes a bit more sense.
我觉得另一双标十五就合理多了。

10
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,600
They're definitely heavy real leather.
它们确实很重，是真皮。

11
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,840
I don't know what any of this stuff on the bottom of the shoe means.
我不知道鞋底这些东西分别是什么意思。

12
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:46,480
But it seems like they were really great and honestly they were really comfy inside too.
但看着很不错，里面穿着也确实舒服。

13
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:55,870
I love the buckle on the side and don't these just look like the free people vibe like this is exactly what I would see on the website or on pinterest or something.
我喜欢侧面的扣子，不觉得很有那种风格吗？简直就是会在官网或 Pinterest 上看到的东西。

14
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:58,280
They're the brand durango which I hadn't heard of before.
它们是 Durango 这个牌子，我以前没听说过。

15
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:01,080
So I definitely texted aj cuz he normally knows about this kind of stuff.
所以我就发消息问了 AJ，因为他通常比较了解这些。

16
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,630
But so cute I mean the the color of the leather is amazing.
不过真可爱，我是说，皮革颜色太漂亮了。

17
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:09,040
I do think a shorter boot is kind of different like I don't see that very often right now.
短筒靴其实有点不一样，因为最近不太常见。

18
00:01:09,040 --> 00:01:13,240
And definitely kind of reminds me of the millennial era of like chelsea boots remember that.
它确实让我想到千禧一代穿切尔西靴的那段时期，还记得吗？

19
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:20,640
But I'm actually really glad that I tried on these boots with this kind of like oversized dress flannel button up situation.
我很庆幸试着用这双靴子，配这件宽大、像裙子一样的法兰绒纽扣衬衫。

20
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:23,519
I swear I've seen this exact type of thing on their website.
我发誓，在它家网站见过一模一样的款式。

21
00:01:23,519 --> 00:01:26,680
It's almost like a duster dress high low thing.
它差不多是那种长罩衫、前后长短不一的裙式衣服。

22
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:34,000
I mean we're really going full millennial right now honestly like this is kind of crazy but once I tucked it in I was like this is a moment.
我们真的完全回到千禧一代风格了，很夸张；但把它塞进去以后，我就觉得，这一套有了。

23
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,480
Like I could see this on the free people website or like in a commercial or something.
我能想象它出现在 Free People 官网，或广告里之类的。

24
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:45,760
I genuinely cannot believe I just created this whole outfit from all pieces that I found at the thrift store in wisconsin like how wild.
真不敢相信，我用威斯康星二手店找到的单品，搭出了整套衣服，太神奇了。

25
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:50,790
Again this isn't for everyone and I definitely think it would take a lot for me to wear this out in public.
这并不适合每个人，真让我穿出去可能还需要很大勇气。

26
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:54,240
But like I like it I don't know I'm kind of shocked honestly.
但我喜欢，我也说不清，老实说我有点惊讶。

27
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:57,759
But definitely appearing this whole outfit together made me like the boots even more.
把整套衣服配起来，让我更喜欢这双靴子了。

28
00:01:57,759 --> 00:02:02,560
And honestly the flannel really I isn't that bad I was expecting to hate it but I kind of love it.
而且法兰绒上衣其实也没那么差，我本来以为会讨厌，却有点喜欢。

29
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:08,280
But you know that I also love a good pair of leather pants and these ones from wild fable are so cute.
不过你们知道，我也爱好看的皮裤，这条 Wild Fable 的很可爱。

30
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:10,879
They're definitely low rise and pretty big in the waist.
它确实低腰，腰围也挺大。

31
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:15,600
But I actually found a seamstress that I'm going to go to and I think she could pretty easily take these in.
但我找到一位裁缝，准备去找她，我觉得她应该能很容易把腰围收小。

32
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:19,960
But this is what I mean when I want wide leg this is so good.
这才是我说想要阔腿时的样子，太好了。

33
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:24,200
I actually do like the low rise because it gives kind of that like effortless cool girl look.
我确实喜欢低腰，因为有种不费力的酷女孩感觉。

34
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:30,640
And it did cross my mind to cut these into shorts I kind of been obsessed with the idea of a cheetah print pair of shorts.
我也闪过把它裁成短裤的念头，最近对猎豹纹短裤这个想法有点着迷。

35
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:36,320
But I don't know if I'd be brave enough to do that but the bummer about these is that they're more on the gray side which I don't love.
但不确定自己够不够大胆；可惜它偏灰色，我没那么喜欢。

36
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:39,750
The free people ones are more brown which I wish that these were.
它家的那条更偏棕，我也希望这条是那种颜色。

37
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:47,720
But let's try on this skirt from american eagle normally I don't like this kind of pencil skirt style but this was so cute it fit perfect.
接着试 American Eagle 的裙子，我一般不爱这种铅笔裙，但这条可爱，穿着也合适。

38
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:50,880
I love the little green trim along the waist and the length.
我喜欢腰边的绿色小镶边，也喜欢长度。

39
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:56,120
I love like normally I feel so uncomfortable in skirts like this but this one I really had no problems with.
平时穿这种裙子会不自在，但这条真的没什么问题。

40
00:02:56,120 --> 00:03:00,040
I thought it was so adorable and with these boots I think would be also really really cute.
我觉得很可爱，配这双靴子也会很好看。

41
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:09,360
And in my opinion what makes this more of a free people vibe is the texture of it being silky I really just don't have anything like this and it kind of elevates the skirt a little bit.
我觉得它的丝滑质感带来了 Free People 感，我没有类似的东西，也让裙子更精致。

42
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:13,440
Now this maxi skirt is definitely a little bit more playful and casual and boho.
这条长裙则更俏皮、休闲、波西米亚。

43
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:17,480
I mean the print is really in your face this honestly fit perfect I love the length.
印花很抢眼，这条真的挺合适，我喜欢长度。

44
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:21,670
And well actually yeah I forgot about the waist being a little big but from the front it looks fine.
不过，对，我忘了腰有点大，但从正面看没问题。

45
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:28,440
But the slit is actually not too bad and I feel like putting these boots with it I can see the free people vision coming to life.
开衩其实不算夸张，配这双靴子，我能看到脑中的 Free People 造型实现了。

46
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:30,720
Like look at this how fun.
看看这套，多有趣。

47
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:34,400
I'm really trying to not be intimidated by really bold patterns like this in a skirt.
我真的在努力不被裙子上这种大胆图案吓住。

48
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:40,500
Cuz I tend to just feel like you can only wear a white top with it which I don't love but that's where we're growing we're learning this year.
因为我总觉得它只能搭白上衣，而我不喜欢那样；不过今年我们在成长、在学习。
